WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.509
Hi, I'm Tilly! Your agents can write to you now.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.000
Two agents are busy, and one of them needs a decision.

00:00:07.851 --> 00:00:09.931
So it sends you a message and asks.

00:00:10.452 --> 00:00:14.052
Control B, then M, opens your mail from any pane.

00:00:14.516 --> 00:00:18.196
Press r to reply. Your answer lands in the agent's inbox.

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:21.369
The agent reads it and carries on.

00:00:23.854 --> 00:00:26.494
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
